<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 2.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 2.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose slightly to 2.78 percent on Sunday from 2.61 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said eight banks traded on the market in 27 reported transactions with a total value of 33.8 million dinars ($47.7 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
